      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GOT A RUSTLER (6) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (22.55) at this track. Has ability and looks hard to stop. MISS BOBBIE (4) last start finished 4th in a Grade 5 on September 6 over 300m at Healesville behind In Action beaten 6 lengths (17.04). Rates a key chance on best figures. PAW XANTHIE (3) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (20.63) in a Grade 5 at Traralgon. Solid record at the distance winning six races. Worth another chance. WHIPSTICK JORDAN (8) scored last time and appeals as a top-three prospect.",
